📋 What your account is for:
  • 👗 Wardrobe — save favourite characters and swap between them instantly.
  • 🏷️ Default tag — pick any cosmetic tag from the catalog and wear it next to your name.
  • ⏱️ Playtime tracking — hours persist across sessions and feed /playtime top.

🔑 Account commands:
  • /register <username> <password>  — create a free account (username 3–20, password 6+)
  • /login <username> <password>     — sign in on reconnect
  • /account                         — view your profile
  • /wardrobe                        — list favourite characters
  • /favourite <char>                — add/remove a character from the wardrobe
  • /playtime top                    — see the playtime leaderboard

🏷️ Default tags — every tag in /shop is FREE to equip:
  • 🎰 gambling   — 30 tags (Gambler, Lucky, High Roller, Whale, Godlike, Infinite…)
  • ⚖️ attorney   — 15 tags (Objection!, Take That!, Hold It!, Prosecutor, Magatama…)
  • 🌸 anime      — 15 tags (Weeb, Senpai, Kawaii, Waifu Haver, Protagonist…)
  • 🎮 gamer      — 15 tags (Noob, Tryhard, Speedrunner, PvP God, Gaming Chair…)
  • 🌷 girly      — 12 tags (Princess, Fairy, Queen, Sparkle, Divine Feminine…)
  • 😂 meme       — 18 tags (Bruh, NPC, Sus, Based, Gigachad, Meme Lord…)
  • 👑 prestige   — 10 tags (Newcomer, Veteran, Grandmaster, Overlord, Absolute Unit…)
  Browse a category:  /shop <category>   (e.g. /shop attorney)
  Equip a tag:        /settag <tag_id>   (e.g. /settag tag_objection)
  Remove your tag:    /settag none

💡 Accounts are entirely optional. Skip /register if you just want to play.#1#%
